### Home
GET http://localhost:5000/

###

### Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cheran",
  "email": "cheran@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "cheran@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

GET http://localhost:5000/api/users

### Create Tournament
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Inter College Cricket Cup",
  "sport": "Cricket",
  "date": "2026-08-01"
}

###

### Get All Tournaments
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments


### Get Tournament by ID
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments/1



### Update Tournament
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "State Cricket Championship"
}

### Delete Tournament
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments/1

### Invalid Registration Test
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "email": "abc",
    "password": "123"
}

### Invalid Tournament Creation Test
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tournaments
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "sport": "",
    "date": ""
}

